      "short": "A woman in a white dress sits before a mirror, seen from behind, with toiletries on a nearby table.",
      "long": "An impressionistic-style painting shows a person from behind and slightly to the side, seated at a dressing area. The figure wears a white, off-the-shoulder gown with thin blue ribbons and a black choker. Their light hair is gathered up. To the left, a vertical mirror reflects blurred forms. A small shelf holds a lidded glass jar, a white flower-like object, and other soft-textured items. The background is rendered in loose, visible brushstrokes of gray, white, pink, and blue, suggesting an indistinct interior space.",
